{25}{Nuh-uh. Me no can ketch theef. Me in her-e! U ketch theef!}{}{-4}{ch 10}{32}{}
{26}{NO! ME NO KETCH THEEF! ME BASH YOU! ME STRONG!}{}{-4}{ra 8}{}{co, fl 29}
{27}{I haven't got time for catching thieves. But I do feel the need to kick some butt!}{}{5}{}{}{co, fl 30}
{28}{Uh, that thief is supposed to escape, what's the use of trying to catch her anyway?}{}{12}{}{162}{}

{29}{Fine. If it's fight you want, then fight's what you get, neanderthal!}{Fine. If it's fight you want, then fight's what you get, neanderthal!}{}{}{}{}
{30}{I can kick your butt any time, mister tough guy!}{I can kick your butt any time, miss tough girl!}{}{}{}{}


{31}{Please hurry up, sir. She's bound to run away any minute now.}{Please hurry up, ma'am. She's bound to run away any minute now.}{}{}{}{}


{32}{[He thinks for a moment.] I.. uh...I think I hear my wife calling...COMING, DEAR!}{[He thinks for a moment.] I.. uh...I think I hear my wife calling...COMING, DEAR!}{}{}{}{}
{33}{See you later then, mr. Chicken!}{}{5}{}{-12}{gv1 83}
{34}{Bye bye, silly meester guy sir!}{}{-4}{}{-12}{gv1 84}
{41}{What's the matter with you? BAH! You're slower than a turtle stuck in a pile of mud! If we had one of Yotland Scards' finest here, she'd be caught in no time.}{What's the matter with you? BAH! You're slower than a turtle stuck in a pile of mud! If we had one of Yotland Scards' finest here, she'd be caught in no time.}{}{}{}{}
{42}{I'm sorry, sir. She was too quick!}{}{5}{}{61}{}
{43}{Me sor-ree. Me slow. She faster.}{}{-4}{}{71}{}
// Nice try, no dice. This arrogant piece of shit ain't buying it. -dju
{44}{Ahem, do you realize you're talking to a Yotland Scard detective, sir?}{}{5}{}{201}{}
// 
{61}{[He imitates you with a mocking voice] "I'm sorry sir, she was too quick" I could've caught her with my hands tied behind my back, you know.}{[He imitates you with a mocking voice] "I'm sorry sir, she was too quick" I could've caught her with my hands tied behind my back, you know.}{}{}{}{}
{62}{Then why didn't you?}{}{5}{}{101}{}

{71}{Damn right you're slow! And obviously it's not only your reflexes but your head seems pretty light as well.  I certainly hope we don't cross paths again.}{Damn right you're slow! And obviously it's not only your reflexes but your head seems pretty light as well. I certainly hope we don't cross paths again.}{}{}{}{}
{72}{You so mean to me. Me go away now. }{}{1}{}{-6}{gv1 81}

{81}{Oh, boo-hoo! ...why do they let these morons run free around the streets of our city..}{Oh, boo-hoo! ...why do they let these morons run free around the streets of our city..}{}{}{}{}
{82}{BAH!}{BAH!}{}{}{}{}
{83}{Oh, shut the hell up!}{Oh, shut the hell up!}{}{}{}{}
{84}{Catch you later, retardo!}{Catch you later, retardo!}{}{}{}{}
{85}{Nope, I don't believe you! I'm SO out of here.. "Yotland Scard.." BAH! That branch is strictly for high quality detectives, not for some damn slackers if you ask me..}{Nope, I don't believe you! I'm SO out of here.. "Yotland Scard.." BAH! That branch is strictly for high quality detectives, not for some damn slackers if you ask me..}{}{}{}{}
{86}{Spare your pathetic mumbo jumbo to someone who cares, mister "detective", 'cos I don't. Care, that is. I'm going away now, if you follow me, I'll beat you up so bad you'll have a hard time figuring out who you are.}{Spare your pathetic mumbo jumbo to someone who cares, miss "detective", 'cos I don't. Care, that is. I'm going away now, if you follow me, I'll beat you up so bad you'll have a hard time figuring out who you are.}{}{}{}{}
