{102}{Don't let me keep you then, I'm sure you're in a big hurry to get busy doing nothing.}{}{1}{}{-6}{gv1 82}


{141}{STOP... THE... THIEF.. DOWN THE ALLEY! Understand?}{STOP... THE... THIEF.. DOWN THE ALLEY! Understand?}{}{}{}{}
{142}{Huh?}{}{-4}{}{181}{}

{151}{...what a numb nuts.. I hope he doesn't pass out from thinking too hard.}{...what a numb nuts.. I hope she doesn't pass out from thinking too hard.}{}{}{}{}

{162}{[He thinks for a moment.] I.. uh...I think you're right...I'll just run over there and become an average generic NPC..}{[He thinks for a moment.] I.. uh...I think you're right...I'll just run over there and become an average generic NPC..}{}{}{}{}
{163}{Yes, that would be good. Now get going, I have a meeting with Chief Shards soon.}{}{12}{}{-12}{gv1 164}

{164}{Sure, sure. Whatever, sir.}{Sure, sure. Whatever, miss.}{}{}{}{}

{181}{Sheesh! Are you that stupid? CATCH THE GOD DAMN THIEF!!! .. DO IT BEFORE SHE RUNS AWAY!!!}{Sheesh! Are you that stupid? CATCH THE GOD DAMN THIEF!!! .. DO IT BEFORE SHE RUNS AWAY!!!}{}{}{}{}
{182}{O-tay. Me ketch theef..}{}{-4}{}{0}{gf5 1, fl 151}

{201}{What? You? Yotland Scard? BAH! You couldn't even catch a damn cold, so why would someone as slow as you get a position in such a fine unit as Yotland Scard? Hmph. This is ridiculous.}{What? You? Yotland Scard? BAH! You couldn't even catch a damn cold, so why would someone as slow as you get a position in such a fine unit as Yotland Scard? Hmph. This is ridiculous.}{}{}{}{}
{202}{But it's true. If you don't believe me, then don't.}{}{5}{}{-6}{gv1 85}
{203}{Uh, I don't believe agility is a required attribute for a detective, sir..}{}{12}{}{}{}
{204}{Let's see if you can catch this, you arrogant piece of turd...}{}{5}{}{}{co, fl 30}

{221}{What the hell are you talking about? If you work in the police department, you must be quick enough to catch thieves, and that's final! I don't have time to debate about the obvious, so please let me go now!}{What the hell are you talking about? If you work in the police department, you must be quick enough to catch thieves, and that's final! I don't have time to debate about the obvious, so please let me go now!}{}{}{}{}
{222}{But, you see, uh, well.. You're wrong, sir. Because...}{}{12}{}{}{gv2 86}

